# The jukebox and the global music channel, with area_update and song_update running. Decimus (10) plays a juke
# box (3200) put at the entrance to Mud School (3700); Smokegod (60) is there too; Purser (10), in quiet mode, and
# Cherub (52), with the music channel off, are in the temple (3001).
# - play with nothing to play on; with nothing named; the list, by song and by artist, all and matching
# - "play list comfortably" lists every song: the word that should match is taken as the list's own option
# - a song that isn't there; examine lists the songs too
# - four songs queued, the fifth refused; the first plays its title and lines, then the next starts
# - play loud: a song on the global channel, heard by everyone not quiet and not with music off; the queue of
#   ten fills, the eleventh is refused; play loud with no song; the first runs to its end and the next starts
# - a jukebox set to a song past the table (25) stops; one set to a row the file didn't fill (18) plays "(null)"
#   and moves on
@updates area,song
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
goto 3700
@connect cher
Cherub
smoke123
@return
@return
music
@connect purse
Purser
psswrd
@return
@return
quiet
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
transfer decimus 3700
transfer cherub 3001
@as dec
play
play bullet
@obj 3200 3700
play list
play list artist
play list artist pink
play list comfortably
play list x comf
play nosuchsong
examine juke
play comfortably
@pulse 72
play bullet
play camarillo
play bullet
play bullet
@pulse 1000
@as god
play loud
play loud bullet
play loud camarillo
play loud camarillo
play loud camarillo
play loud camarillo
play loud camarillo
play loud camarillo
play loud camarillo
play loud camarillo
play loud camarillo
play loud camarillo
@pulse 96
@obj 3200 3700 -1 25 -1 -1 -1
@obj 3200 3700 -1 18 -1 -1 -1
@pulse 72
@pulse 720
@state
